untered some regression trying to update the lib to the last version (4.6.2) :cry: .\r\nI have mostly the same problems I had described in this issue (https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/99).\r\n\r\nThis sandbox works : https://codesandbox.io/s/react-hook-form-seterror-fj6ds?fontsize=14 (3.13.1)\r\nthis one doesn't : https://codesandbox.io/s/react-hook-form-seterror-fj1uh (4.6.2).\r\n\r\nIssues are\r\n- Form not being blocked when submitted.\r\n- Errors reset when clicking out of the field (sort of randomly, happens most after the form has been sent once).\r\n\r\nIt's unfortunate because I needed that update, with the version 3.13.1 I had problem with watch() not being updated fast enough for comparison purposes, with the last version and the help of the Controller component I was able to do so.\r\n\r\nMainly, I'd like to be able to do comparison between fields or being able to set a global error on the form.\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your help,","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/898/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/898/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":7596715594,"node_id":"LOE_lADOCl-cD84bcXPozwAAAAHEzK5K","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/events/7596715594","actor":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h